2026-09-28  Aidan Horn  <aidan@codera.co.za>

	- version = "latest" (the default) in read_dataset, read_database, read_release
	  and read_registry is now resolved client-side by numeric comparison of each
	  dot-separated version component (1.2.13 > 1.2.9). The API compared version
	  strings lexicographically and returned the wrong version once a component
	  reached two digits (GitHub issue #46)

